{"version":"1.2.0","category":"27_ui_ux_accessibility","entries":[{"expression":"導線を引く","interpretation":"利用者が目的画面・操作へ進む経路を設計する","context":["利用者","画面","操作"],"context_policy":"required_any","domain":"UI導線","version":"1.2.0"},{"expression":"導線を切る","interpretation":"不要・危険・混乱を招く画面遷移を除去する","context":["画面","遷移","利用者"],"context_policy":"required_any","domain":"UI導線","version":"1.2.0"},{"expression":"迷子をなくす","interpretation":"利用者が現在地や次の操作を見失わないようにする","context":["利用者","操作","画面"],"context_policy":"required_any","domain":"Navigation","version":"1.2.0"},{"expression":"入口を見せる","interpretation":"機能開始点や主要Actionを明確に表示する","context":["機能","Action","画面"],"context_policy":"required_any","domain":"UI認知","version":"1.2.0"},{"expression":"出口を見せる","interpretation":"完了・戻る・取消など終了経路を明確に表示する","context":["完了","戻る","取消"],"context_policy":"required_any","domain":"UI認知","version":"1.2.0"},{"expression":"画面を詰め込む","interpretation":"一画面に過剰な情報や操作を配置する","context":["画面","情報","操作"],"context_policy":"required_any","domain":"情報過多","version":"1.2.0"},{"expression":"画面に余白を作る","interpretation":"視認性や理解のため情報間隔を確保する","context":["画面","情報","視認性"],"context_policy":"required_any","domain":"Visual Design","version":"1.2.0"},{"expression":"情報を畳む","interpretation":"詳細情報をAccordionなどで一時的に非表示にする","context":["情報","Accordion","詳細"],"context_policy":"required_any","domain":"情報階層","version":"1.2.0"},{"expression":"情報を開く","interpretation":"非表示の詳細情報を展開して確認可能にする","context":["情報","詳細","Accordion"],"context_policy":"required_any","domain":"情報階層","version":"1.2.0"},{"expression":"視線を流す","interpretation":"視覚的階層で読む順序を自然に誘導する","context":["視線","順序","画面"],"context_policy":"required_any","domain":"Visual Hierarchy","version":"1.2.0"},{"expression":"視線を止める","interpretation":"重要情報へ注意を集中させる","context":["重要","注意","画面"],"context_policy":"required_any","domain":"Visual Hierarchy","version":"1.2.0"},{"expression":"手数を減らす","interpretation":"目的達成までに必要な操作回数を削減する","context":["操作","回数","利用者"],"context_policy":"required_any","domain":"操作効率","version":"1.2.0"},{"expression":"手数を増やす","interpretation":"確認・安全のため意図的に操作段階を追加する","context":["確認","安全","操作"],"context_policy":"required_any","domain":"安全操作","version":"1.2.0"},{"expression":"読み順を整える","interpretation":"Screen Readerや視覚上の情報順序を論理的にする","context":["Screen Reader","順序","情報"],"context_policy":"required_any","domain":"Accessibility","version":"1.2.0"},{"expression":"焦点を当てる","interpretation":"主要機能・情報へ視覚的または操作Focusを置く","context":["Focus","主要","画面"],"context_policy":"required_any","domain":"Focus管理","version":"1.2.0"},{"expression":"焦点を外す","interpretation":"不要な要素から視覚的・操作上の強調を除く","context":["Focus","要素","画面"],"context_policy":"required_any","domain":"Focus管理","version":"1.2.0"},{"expression":"操作を迷わせる","interpretation":"表示・Label・順序の不一致で利用者を混乱させる","context":["操作","Label","利用者"],"context_policy":"required_any","domain":"UX Risk","version":"1.2.0"},{"expression":"選択を迫る","interpretation":"判断材料不足のまま利用者に選択を要求する","context":["選択","利用者","判断"],"context_policy":"required_any","domain":"UX Risk","version":"1.2.0"}]}